---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Sentinel-Bench — Personal Cyber Threat Intelligence" active="landing">

  <main class="landing landing-page">

    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="eyebrow">
          <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
          Personal Cyber Threat Intelligence
        </div>
        <h1 class="hero-title">
          Sabé qué se está<br />
          <span class="hero-accent">explotando</span> hoy, no mañana.
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">
          Sentinel-Bench ingiere CISA KEV, NVD, EPSS, GHSA y MSRC en una sola línea de tiempo priorizada por <em>explotación real</em>, no por score inflado. Tu lista de vendors, tu filtro, tu feed.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a href="/dashboard/" class="btn-primary">Abrir Dashboard en vivo →</a>
          <a href="/sources/" class="btn-secondary">Ver las 5 fuentes</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-meta">
          <span><strong>5</strong> fuentes curadas</span>
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span><strong>30 min</strong> entre ingestas</span>
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <span><strong>100%</strong> open source</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- STATS -->
    <section class="stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num">5</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Fuentes oficiales<br /><small>CISA KEV · NVD · EPSS · GHSA · MSRC</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num">30<span class="stat-unit">min</span></div>
        <div class="stat-label">Cadencia de ingestión<br /><small>KEV + GHSA cada media hora</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num">4</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Capas de filtrado<br /><small>vendor · dominio · urgencia · severidad</small></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="stat-num">0</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Telemetría saliente<br /><small>sin trackers, sin analytics, sin cookies</small></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CÓMO SE VE -->
    <section class="features">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">Cómo se ve</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Tres pantallas, una decisión.</h2>
      <div class="feature-grid">
        <article class="feature">
          <div class="feature-num">01</div>
          <h3>Feed priorizado por explotación real</h3>
          <p>No es una lista de CVEs. Es una lista de cosas que <em>alguien</em> confirmó que se están rompiendo en este momento. Filtrá por dominio (IT / OT), urgencia (Act Now / Plan Patch / Monitor / Low Risk) y severidad.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <div class="feature-num">02</div>
          <h3>Tus vendors primero</h3>
          <p>Seleccionás qué fabricantes te importan (Cisco, Microsoft, Apache, lo que uses). El feed colapsa el ruido. Sin scroll infinito, sin 2000 vulns irrelevantes sobre productos que no corrés.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="feature">
          <div class="feature-num">03</div>
          <h3>KEV en un click</h3>
          <p>El catálogo CISA KEV integrado — la lista corta de "explotado en la calle, tenés que patchear". Toggle de un botón. Lo que aparece en rojo es lo que ya está quemando plata afuera.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- POR QUÉ IMPORTA -->
    <section class="why">
      <div class="why-grid">
        <div class="why-copy">
          <div class="section-eyebrow">Por qué importa</div>
          <h2 class="section-title">El feed público es ruido.</h2>
          <p>
            NVD te tira <strong>40.000 CVEs por año</strong>. Menos del 4% tiene exploit público conocido. Menos del 1% está siendo activamente explotado. Sentinel-Bench corta el 96% que no necesitás ver y deja lo que tenés que mirar esta semana.
          </p>
          <p>
            No es un panel lindo — es una herramienta operativa. Para el CISO que patchea los martes y el pentester que necesita qué probar esta semana.
          </p>
        </div>
        <aside class="why-side">
          <div class="why-stat">
            <div class="why-stat-num">~3%</div>
            <div class="why-stat-label">de los CVEs publicados tienen exploit público</div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-stat">
            <div class="why-stat-num">~0.4%</div>
            <div class="why-stat-label">están en KEV (explotados en la calle)</div>
          </div>
          <div class="why-stat">
            <div class="why-stat-num">5 min</div>
            <div class="why-stat-label">es lo que tarda abrir el feed y decidir qué patchear</div>
          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA FINAL -->
    <section class="cta-final">
      <div class="cta-inner">
        <h2>Probalo en 30 segundos.</h2>
        <p>Sin signup, sin cookie, sin waitlist. El dashboard está abierto.</p>
        <div class="cta-buttons">
          <a href="/dashboard/" class="btn-primary">Abrir Dashboard →</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/iamtweaks/sentinel-bench" rel="noopener" target="_blank" class="btn-secondary">Ver el código en GitHub</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <style>
    .landing {
      max-width: 1120px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    /* HERO */
    .hero { padding: 96px 0 64px; }
    .hero-inner { max-width: 820px; }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border-2);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--panel);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .eyebrow-dot {
      width: 6px; height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--accent-light);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--accent-light);
      animation: pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes pulse {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
      50%      { opacity: 0.55; transform: scale(0.85); }
    }

    .hero-title {
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      color: var(--text);
      margin: 0 0 24px;
    }
    .hero-accent {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent-light) 0%, var(--accent) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      background-clip: text;
      color: transparent;
    }
    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 0 0 32px;
    }
    .hero-sub em {
      color: var(--text);
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .hero-cta {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: var(--text);
      border: 1px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.15), 0 4px 18px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.25);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: var(--accent-hover);
      border-color: var(--accent-hover);
      transform: translateY(-1px);
    }
    .btn-secondary {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-2);
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 500;
      font-size: 14.5px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      color: var(--text);
      border-color: var(--accent-border);
    }

    .hero-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .hero-meta strong {
      color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-right: 4px;
    }
    .hero-meta .dot {
      width: 3px; height: 3px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--muted-2);
    }

    /* STATS */
    .stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 0;
      padding: 48px 0 56px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin: 16px 0 64px;
    }
    .stat {
      padding: 16px 22px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .stat:last-child { border-right: none; }
    .stat-num {
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: 48px;
      font-weight: 800;
      line-height: 1;
      color: var(--text);
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .stat-unit {
      font-size: 24px;
      color: var(--accent-light);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .stat-label {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    .stat-label small {
      display: block;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11.5px;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }

    /* SECTION GENERIC */
    .section-eyebrow {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--accent-light);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .section-title {
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
      line-height: 1.15;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      color: var(--text);
      margin: 0 0 40px;
      max-width: 720px;
    }

    /* FEATURES */
    .features { padding: 24px 0 80px; }
    .feature-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }
    .feature {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-2);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 28px 24px 24px;
      transition: border-color 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
    }
    .feature:hover {
      border-color: var(--accent-border);
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
    .feature-num {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .feature h3 {
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--text);
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      line-height: 1.3;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }
    .feature p {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      margin: 0;
    }
    .feature p em {
      color: var(--text);
      font-style: normal;
    }

    /* WHY */
    .why { padding: 32px 0 80px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .why-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.3fr 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .why-copy p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      margin: 0 0 16px;
    }
    .why-copy p strong {
      color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .why-side {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--border-2);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 22px;
    }
    .why-stat {
      padding: 16px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .why-stat:last-child { border-bottom: none; padding-bottom: 0; }
    .why-stat:first-child { padding-top: 0; }
    .why-stat-num {
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--accent-light);
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .why-stat-label {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    /* CTA FINAL */
    .cta-final {
      padding: 80px 0 96px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .cta-inner { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .cta-final h2 {
      font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      color: var(--text);
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      line-height: 1.15;
    }
    .cta-final p {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: var(--text-dim);
      margin: 0 0 28px;
    }
    .cta-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    /* NAV CTA pill (in landing page) — overrides Base.astro nav styles */
    :global(.landing-page) header.nav a.nav-cta {
      color: var(--accent-light);
      padding: 5px 12px !important;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.14);
      font-weight: 500 !important;
      font-size: 12.5px;
      transition: background 0.15s ease;
    }
    :global(.landing-page) header.nav a.nav-cta:hover {
      background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.24);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    @media (max-width: 880px) {
      .hero { padding: 64px 0 40px; }
      .stats {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
      .stat {
        border-right: none;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 18px 16px;
      }
      .stat:nth-child(2n) { border-right: none; }
      .stat:nth-child(odd) { border-right: 1px solid var(--border); }
      .stat:nth-last-child(-n+2) { border-bottom: none; }
      .feature-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .why-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 32px;
      }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      .eyebrow-dot { animation: none; }
      .btn-primary, .btn-secondary, .feature {
        transition: none;
      }
    }
  </style>

</Base>
